# Session-local state, by the `.local.` convention the tools that write it use.
# NOT all of .claude/ — that legitimately holds committed project config (agents,
# settings). Only the per-session scratch, which is one session's loop counter and
# has no meaning to anyone who checks the repo out.
.claude/*.local.*

